# ctrim_app tests

- Unit tests: `test/unit/models/<model>_test.dart`
- Groups mirror public API: constructor, fromMap, toJson, getters, setters
- Prefer real objects for pure Dart models (no mock library in pubspec yet)

```bash
flutter test test/unit/
flutter analyze
```

Add `mockito` or `mocktail` to dev_dependencies only when Firebase mocking is required.
